<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 25/28.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 25/28.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Friday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for July 28. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   28.07.97	  25.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6508	    6.6892</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1785	    2.1899</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.3108	    4.3358</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4420	    3.4532</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5047	    0.5104</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7369	    0.7443</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2723	    0.2738</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8942	    6.9114</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6894	    0.6905</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1643	    1.1603</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
